Roshni includes material from the following third-party projects.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
ha-solarman — https://github.com/davidrapan/ha-solarman
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The inverter profiles in app/src/main/assets/inverters/*.json are derived
from ha-solarman's inverter definitions
(custom_components/solarman/inverter_definitions/*.yaml, as of commit
ac1d88b): register addresses, word order, scales, signs and status
codes were taken from deye_p3.yaml, deye_hybrid.yaml, sofar_g3.yaml,
sofar_g3hyd.yaml, sofar_hybrid.yaml, solis_hybrid.yaml, solis_3p-5g.yaml,
kstar_hybrid.yaml, afore_hybrid.yaml, megarevo_r-3h.yaml, renon_ifl.yaml,
invt_xd-tl.yaml and anenji_hybrid.yaml, and rewritten into Roshni's own
format. Each profile's "source" field names the file it came from.

