pysolarmanv5 — https://github.com/jmccrohan/pysolarmanv5
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Solarman V5 framing in data/local/SolarmanV5.kt follows the protocol
description and frame encoder/decoder in pysolarmanv5 by Jonathan McCrohan.
No code was copied; see the comments in that file.
